              "name": "Bose Cinema",
              "ip": "192.0.2.12",
              "mac": "AABBCC000012",
              "product_code": "Lifestyle",
              "account_id": "1000001"
            },
            "is_console": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "divergence": "DELIBERATE DIVERGENCE from the pre-rebuild code, decided by the user 2026-09-19. The old parse discarded the WHOLE device list when any one entry failed validation; this one keeps the usable entries, names each dropped one through log, and refuses only when NOTHING in a non-empty list validates. Measured in the flat that day: AfterTouch writes a placeholder entry for anything answering SSDP before it can read its details, so a non-Bose device took the real speakers out of the service's view and the zone could hold nobody. This case is therefore NOT evidence of equivalence with the old code; the cases without this key still are."
    },
